stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> PENDING: POST /tasks
    PENDING --> RUNNING: el worker arranca
    RUNNING --> DONE: terminó
    RUNNING --> AWAITING_APPROVAL: interrupt()
    AWAITING_APPROVAL --> RUNNING: POST /approve
    RUNNING --> REJECTED: rechazado
    RUNNING --> FAILED: excepción o timeout
    DONE --> [*]
    REJECTED --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]

    classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#15803d,color:#14532d
    classDef espera fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#b45309,color:#78350f
    classDef mal fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#b91c1c,color:#7f1d1d
    class DONE ok
    class AWAITING_APPROVAL espera
    class FAILED, REJECTED mal
